p3 = {title: "3. Design", description: "Requirements, architecture and approved specifications", status: "active"}
p4 = {title: "4. Execution", description: "Build, test and integrate the deliverables", status: "pending"}
p5 = {title: "5. Monitoring & Control", description: "Track progress, quality and change requests throughout", status: "pending"}
p6 = {title: "6. Closure", description: "Handover, documentation, retrospective and sign-off", status: "pending"}
:::

Phases 1–2 are the foundation, phase 4 is usually where most time and budget goes, and phase 5 runs in parallel with execution rather than after it. Tell me your actual phase names and dates and I'll map the timeline to them.

